metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://b6jopat61dbd3"

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_tool")
icon = ExtResource("1_icon")
label = "Import/Export"
tooltip = "Import/Export Tool

Exports the terrain to versioned JSON (absolute axial hex coords) or imports it back.

[INFO]
• \"Export Path\" is the JSON file the terrain is written to (res:// or absolute path).
• \"Import Path\" is the JSON file to read terrain from.
• \"Export\" writes all chunks of the current terrain to the export path.
• \"Import\" reads the import path, creating any missing chunks, and overwrites the hexes it contains."
attributes = SubResource("Resource_import_export")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://brkjbcthwswel"
